            <div xml:id="m-8043f210-5087-4610-9099-9a550f99b5e5">
              <lg xml:id="m-10b39fe9-b851-44c6-b57b-d38b94f59589">
                <l xml:id="m-dedaf543-c957-42c0-a44c-eb6cfd4e20ca" facs="#m-285efa78-653f-47df-9167-2e91e8b3198b" label="text-like">At Matins.</l><l xml:id="m-e0f7ddbc-ed6e-4b91-a4bf-d23ab81fb13a" facs="#m-7114dab8-5285-4b02-bb7c-f195ec015b78" label="ambiguous">028</l><l xml:id="m-65fa9c42-e9d0-4dbc-afb1-d7733b3546da" facs="#m-ea5fe2db-8e23-4fd3-954a-2ed912f6188d" label="lyrics-like">me-órum non é¬ ges.</l><l xml:id="m-4783fbf0-c1d1-4fca-8951-c46648a960cd" facs="#m-a8ed9e16-8a0b-49fe-a987-30b5bf083579" label="lyrics-like">2. Sánctis, qui sunt in térra éjus, * mirificávit ómnes voluntátes</l><l xml:id="m-a0e44979-1745-45af-91ea-29994fac6a3e" facs="#m-d7d7109d-10c9-4233-820e-756516dd94a3" label="lyrics-like">méas in éis.</l><l xml:id="m-8b13e184-854f-4710-8466-244f871e779c" facs="#m-403ec3ad-c050-4306-8c5b-51ff7bb99090" label="lyrics-like">3. Multiplicátae sunt infirmitátes eórum:postea acceleravérunt.</l><l xml:id="m-9d3faa31-2d19-4b4b-a09b-184b821a45c0" facs="#m-c75d08ec-176b-4502-a827-c0005337e6db" label="lyrics-like">4. Non congregábo conventícula eórum de sanguinibus: * nec</l><l xml:id="m-10067fca-992a-4bbf-be82-a84efbb91866" facs="#m-f19ab632-470e-42a7-80c3-8a7b4d73d1cd" label="lyrics-like">mémor éro nóminum eórum per lábia méa.</l><l xml:id="m-8e3c5d5d-6d14-4e48-97e6-0945726f1d44" facs="#m-79cdb8be-4ab5-4d8b-a63a-43a18686b180" label="lyrics-like">5. Dóminus pars hereditátis méae, et cálicis méi: * tu es, qui</l><l xml:id="m-758bcbff-c748-46e7-b730-d338330fb683" facs="#m-3252b778-05fe-4d74-81bf-9a475efb6c47" label="lyrics-like">restitues hereditátem méam mihi.</l><l xml:id="m-38a976e1-2c1b-4619-9e89-a773eeb17bc9" facs="#m-77490980-67af-415d-942a-3ac08365904a" label="lyrics-like">6. Fûnes cecidérunt mihi in praecláris: *étenim heréditas méa</l><l xml:id="m-0f2a0035-9b8d-4eb7-b2f9-d2067b0306d2" facs="#m-45ef05a6-c771-461a-9405-e8d204f18572" label="lyrics-like">praeclára est mihi.</l><l xml:id="m-486460d9-559b-4fc2-aa29-103d67d5d28a" facs="#m-271abede-cca9-48e5-9d24-ab4ecbd186a7" label="lyrics-like">7. Benedicam Dóminum, qui tribuit mihi intelléctum:*insuper et</l><l xml:id="m-eb8c34a5-3a3a-4bab-b694-7d34ff0de6e6" facs="#m-5dcc5af8-b13f-41b8-94a1-81eac12cab03" label="lyrics-like">usque ad nóctem increpuérunt me rênes méi.</l><l xml:id="m-bfe4167f-5bcf-44ca-99fd-f766a41279fb" facs="#m-6ef36de7-6620-4eb4-8846-4151d6c3f160" label="lyrics-like">8. Providébam Dóminum in conspéctu méo sémper:“quóniam a</l><l xml:id="m-f31b3568-c249-4275-918a-6bf2dcf42dae" facs="#m-04ed421c-1629-4e7d-9bc4-ebb4df1e5d5b" label="lyrics-like">déxtris est míhi, ne commóvear.</l><l xml:id="m-f1e8a9ff-08c7-49db-b439-2a8279843baf" facs="#m-1ff54481-5739-43f7-b93a-5d3521f85a68" label="lyrics-like">9. Propter hoc laetátum est cor méum, et exsultávit lingua méa:</l><l xml:id="m-4f1218b3-04ad-4889-8fdd-8a3e4025eb2b" facs="#m-b8895d2b-a1f5-4036-88b0-d5753a59ea98" label="lyrics-like">insuper et cáro méa requiéscet in spe.</l><l xml:id="m-63f894b9-a839-46d4-b0c2-9f3d3d1c13ee" facs="#m-9d87001e-016a-45bb-83e2-942d09fde30a" label="lyrics-like">10. Quóniam non derelinques ánimam méam in inférno:* nec dábis</l><l xml:id="m-51bc7d61-04fe-42a4-af7f-a989b5f31016" facs="#m-3db89662-62e3-4853-ac15-5a0926ef53db" label="lyrics-like">sánctum túum vidére corruptiónem.</l><l xml:id="m-d14f26c9-491f-4adb-85f2-298746dde4c1" facs="#m-2ccb589c-2dc7-41fd-ae31-22f3ed8471f2" label="lyrics-like">11. Nótas míhi fecísti vías vitae, t adimplébis me laetítia cum vúltu</l><l xml:id="m-ebd53ee6-7f28-4ccd-8005-6c683719c92c" facs="#m-9fc3d6b9-d564-48d7-ba6d-d91462995930" label="lyrics-like">túo:*delectatiónes in déxtera túa usque in finem.</l><l xml:id="m-02f7058d-3392-4bb5-9541-2060d5b71059" facs="#m-2c09752f-6695-4a25-bace-124ca3d68d14" label="lyrics-like">12. Glória Pátri, et Filio, *et Spiritui Sáncto.</l><l xml:id="m-2fe5959d-99b7-48b1-9b1a-96652fde6c12" facs="#m-f4ff40f7-1e07-4f4a-97d5-161138f8a089" label="lyrics-like">13. Sicut érat in princípio, et núne, et sémper, *et in saécula saecu¬</l><l xml:id="m-3189dced-5f39-411d-b8ea-d3d5d120eb87" facs="#m-25bd13b9-ad41-421f-b984-e8e7155337a6" label="lyrics-like">tórum. Amen.</l><l xml:id="m-6ecb4787-7109-4082-9b6c-6c19fab41190" facs="#m-6f43e75b-4cb6-47a6-97d6-56257cf3eace" label="lyrics-like">V. Pánem caéli dédit é-is,</l><l xml:id="m-18359090-93ad-4dfc-a149-9b8ce05755ef" facs="#m-ed8eb9bd-30f4-4a73-9fa5-ee96e14beb3f" label="lyrics-like">alle-lú-ia.</l><l xml:id="m-1708d9d0-b78e-4482-9ae5-3a571a041df2" facs="#m-6ead082e-a3ea-46d4-acee-58ffee7f615b" label="lyrics-like">N. Pânem Angelórum manducávit hómo, alle-lú-ia.</l><l xml:id="m-1f80e030-c672-44ce-8760-6cb43ef7c25f" facs="#m-00f760a8-1a1a-4f43-bc8c-2e5f4e6d1eeb" label="lyrics-like">Páter nóster. V. Et ne nos indúcas in tentati-ônem.</l><l xml:id="m-95d9a01b-1757-4278-a2cf-a2d49e27e2ea" facs="#m-35dd620b-f318-4881-9fec-1dfabb9f44fc" label="lyrics-like">N. Sed líbera nos a má-lo.</l><l xml:id="m-07b643db-64f8-4bba-a924-0ba0c2485627" facs="#m-7787de24-020f-44e6-bc4e-761166a09fac" label="lyrics-like">Absolutton. Exáudi Dómine Jésu Christe préces servórum tuórum, t et</l><l xml:id="m-d470446c-4f82-456b-a926-b365771e659a" facs="#m-f0976019-c57b-4517-a90b-2a8df9d736df" label="lyrics-like">miserére nóbis, * qui cum Pâtre et Spiritu Sáncto vivis et régnas in</l><l xml:id="m-fa7006e8-60bd-45c6-8b93-48cae51a6254" facs="#m-00026e01-3d20-428b-8aa8-b28c161984cc" label="lyrics-like">saécula saeculórum. K. Amen.</l><l xml:id="m-02772283-9868-46a1-81d5-7819e74aeee0" facs="#m-5230c8fc-efad-4dfa-a669-a9f57d31b814" label="lyrics-like">The Lector : Júbe, dómne, benedicere.</l><l xml:id="m-5d50829e-baa8-44b0-8b94-d525ac24a76e" facs="#m-9a166d0d-195a-44df-8bb7-79192816a217" label="lyrics-like">Blessing: Benedictióne perpétua * benedicat nos Páter aetérnus.</l><l xml:id="m-751e18bf-05ad-4022-aaa1-2275cac0cdf3" facs="#m-f6d4f01e-f0e6-437d-b1c5-03abed021d4a" label="ambiguous">R. Amen.</l><l xml:id="m-b6e16706-16a2-44c6-ad28-6c5c5ee29779" facs="#m-96e214f0-2e9c-4efd-bde1-8c6eb3eeeb5a" label="ambiguous">Lesson I.</l><l xml:id="m-0c8ec590-4f1b-4833-8a7f-e9887353aad5" facs="#m-c34f85fb-a857-4dd6-94fb-3b8eaea7608a" label="lyrics-like">De Epistola prima beáti Pauli Apóstoli ad Corínthios. Cap. 11.</l><l xml:id="m-7a0c8c60-52af-48d2-9ee2-a5f507523b6c" facs="#m-c076133f-e61d-457d-b57a-607b0cbe0218" label="lyrics-like">vOnveniéntibus vobis in unum, suam coenam praesúmit ad man¬</l><l xml:id="m-fa24f9f5-1fd2-4247-a4b1-12318337c6ba" facs="#m-185db500-fe62-4b96-83ae-d7acdd4921ce" label="lyrics-like"> jam non est Domínicam coenam ducándum. Et álius quidem ésurit:</l><l xml:id="m-1168c072-941c-4d8f-8d83-3e8ece9618f9" facs="#m-8d88c4e7-b2d9-403d-a2b1-e8198088b2b0" label="lyrics-like">manducáre. Unusquísque enim! álius autem ébrius est. Numquid</l></lg>
            </div>
          </section>
        </score>
      </mdiv>
    </body>
  </music>
</mei>